 offering thoughtfully designed 1, 2 & 3 BHK homes that reflect comfort, peace & modern urban living. Recognized as the tallest & largest residential address in Kandivali West, this prestigious development introduces international lifestyle features to the city for the first time. With a tranquil environment, innovative design & state-of-the-art recreational amenities, Sangam Emporio Towers caters to the aspirations of new-age homebuyers. It's more than just a home it's an elevated real estate offering that combines serenity, style & sophistication in one of Mumbai’s most sought-after neighborhoods.\n\nConfiguration\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2024\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹26,667/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n450 - 942 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Located in the prime neighborhood of Kandivali West.\n* Blends international design standards with local comfort.\n* Equipped with state-of-the-art lifestyle amenities.\n* Recognized as the tallest & largest residential address in Kandivali West.\n\n* Offers spacious and well-designed 1, 2 & 3 BHK homes.\n* Designed for new-age homebuyers seeking peace & modernity.\n* Serene and rejuvenating ambience ideal for urban living.\n* Excellent connectivity to schools, hospitals, business hubs & transport links.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/Car-Parking-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Car-Parking-secondary.svg)\n\nCar Parking Space\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary.svg)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities