 - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800031000](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800031000)\n\nEmporio Towers\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Sangam Emporio Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Sangam Emporio Towers is 31 Dec 2025\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Sangam Emporio Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Sangam Emporio Towers is 450 - 942 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Sangam Emporio Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Sangam Emporio Towers is ₹1.2 Cr - 2.51 Cr\n\n### Where is Sangam Emporio Towers located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nSangam Emporio Towers is located at Emporio Towers, Sector 2 Charkop, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067.\n\n### What configurations are available in Sangam Emporio Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nSangam Emporio Towers has 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Sangam Emporio Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Sangam Emporio Towers is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Sangam Emporio Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are Car Parking Space, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Intercom Facility, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Landscape Garden, Large Green Area, Party Lawn, Senior citizen Area, Spacious Clubhouse, Walking Area, Well Designed Entrance Lobby, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Sangam Emporio Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Sangam Emporio Towers is Sangam Developers.\n\n## About