Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 84889](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/Amenities/f56ce1a8d8bb0271ca61c82ad2e73556.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Amenities of Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 84890](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/Amenities/f70dd05569fdf7ce5773c2e5c1e2415d.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Sample Apartment of Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 84891](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/Sample%20Apartment/3a43e2760ac0da59fcb0bdf4e9db4e60.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Sample Apartment of Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 84892](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/Sample%20Apartment/ad550fc6ec11b904070dd057573dbfa9.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Sample Apartment of Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 84893](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/Sample%20Apartment/c80a2bf090c76267495b497271232187.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Sample Apartment of Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 84894](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/Sample%20Apartment/e41c2f198e49bc1bc54b967be8695dc6.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Location of Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 84895](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/Location/d3b993c559ecc31de82a63fdbd5b66d1.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n## Project Overview of Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n204 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n0.92 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n4 Towers / 22 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nSangam Emporio Towers, situated in the serene locality of Charkop, Kandivali West, Mumbai, epitomizes luxury living at an affordable cost. Developed by Sangam Developers, this residential project stands out as one of the most coveted addresses in Charkop for its blend of comfort, quality, and affordability. The project offers spacious apartments, meticulously designed to cater to modern living needs, ensuring ample space for residents to relax and unwind.  \n  \nSangam Emporio Towers boast impeccable construction standards, reflecting the developer's commitment to quality and durability. The serene ambiance of the location adds to the allure of this project, providing residents with a peaceful retreat from the hustle and bustle of city life. Moreover, the proximity to nearby markets ensures convenience and accessibility for daily needs.  \n  \nWith its combination of luxurious amenities, prime location, and reasonable pricing, Sangam Emporio Towers presents an enticing opportunity for individuals seeking a comfortable and stylish living space in Mumbai. This project stands as a testament to Sangam Developers' dedication to delivering homes that exceed expectations and redefine the concept of affordable luxury in the real estate landscape.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![1 BHK Flat in Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 642280](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/BHK_Configuration/3d6548c55a7bc514eeb67ba707e6ddc8.webp)\n\n1 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n431 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.04 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 642281](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/BHK_Configuration/b3dcbf6061db6e05a2852c72980c2f95.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n673 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.62 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 642282](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/BHK_Configuration/c6c45ef265a3adcd6807ce627ff75a23.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n942 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.3 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 84896](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/9454/Floor%20Plan/f2e1356be84a7cdcb9a5a947f69e4f0b.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Seamless Connectivity.\n* Luxurious Living.\n* Spacious Apartments.\n* Serene Ambiance.\n* Modern Amenities.\n* Quality Construction.\n\n## Amenities Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* 24X7 Water Supply\n* Power Back Up\n* Solar Power\n* Meditation Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Senior Citizens' Walking Track\n* Parking and transportation\n* Clubhouse\n* Multipurpose Hall\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Earthquake-resistant\n* 24/7 Security\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n\n* Community Club\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Pool Deck With Sun\n* Swimming Pool\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Laminated Flush Doors\n\n## Google Map Location of Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Kandivali West](/location-review/mumbai/kandivali-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Kandivali West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Kandivali West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nSangam Emporio Towers is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800031000](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800031000)\n\nProject: Sangam Emporio Towers\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West\n\n---\n\n* Nirmal Junior College\n* Balbharti College Of Commerce\n* Hebron School\n* Kb Patil International School\n\n* BMC HospitaI\n* Saraswati Hospital\n* Paarth Hospital\n* Namaha Hospital\n\n* Infinity 2 Mall\n* Thakur Mall\n* Reliance Digital\n* D Mart\n\n* Sainath Refreshment\n* The Dessert Clubb\n* Diann's\n* Cherrys Kitchen\n\n![Sangam Developers](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/7528d0cb85f7b683111a1f1aed06113e.webp)\n\n## [Sangam Developers](/mumbai/sale/builder/sangam-developers-4839)\n\nOngoing Projects: 1\n\nTotal Projects: 1\n\n---\n\nSangam Developers, a leading entity in India's real estate and property development sector, boasts a visionary approach aimed at revolutionizing the nation's infrastructure landscape. With architects and engineers harboring a futuristic perspective, their designs anticipate the housing needs of tomorrow. Renowned for their unwavering commitment and ethical practices, Sangam Developers' team comprises skilled and determined professionals dedicated to reshaping India's infrastructure.  \n  \nTheir expertise is evident in the accolades showered upon them by satisfied customers and clients, serving as a testament to their dedication and hard work. Through innovative designs and unwavering dedication, Sangam Developers are poised to leave an indelible mark on India's real estate industry, setting new standards for excellence and redefining the concept of modern living.  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Sangam Developers](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/sangam-developers-4839)\n\n## FAQ's about Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Kandivali West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Kandivali West\n\n* [Apartments in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n\n### Explore Projects in Kandivali West\n\n* [New Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Pre Launch Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/possession/pre-launch)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move)\n\n### Homes by BHK in Kandivali West\n\n* [1BHK Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/1bhk)\n* [2BHK Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/2bhk)\n* [3BHK Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/3bhk)\n* [4+ BHK Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/4-plus-bhk)\n* [4BHK Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/4bhk)\n\n### Homes by Budget in Kandivali West\n\n* [Homes in Kandivali West Above 5 Cr](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/budget/above-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Kandivali West Between 1 Cr to 2 Cr](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/budget/between-1-cr-to-2-cr)\n* [Homes in Kandivali West Between 2 Cr to 5 Cr](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/budget/between-2-cr-to-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Kandivali West Between 50 Lakh to 1 Cr](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/budget/between-50-lakh-to-1-cr)\n* [Homes in Kandivali West Under 50 Lakh](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/budget/under-50-lakh)\n\n### Homes by View in Kandivali West\n\n* [Open View Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/property-view/open-view)\n\n### Explore Nearby Localities\n\n* [Homes in Goregaon East](/mumbai-goregaon.east/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Malad East](/mumbai-malad.east/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Malad West](/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats)\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/sangam-emporio-towers-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/1991","title":"Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West | Latest Price, Floor Plans & Brochure","raw_content":"[![keystonerealestateadvisory.com](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/gallery/ks-logo.webp)](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n\nAll Categories\n\n* All Categories\n* Shops\n* Hotels\n* Restaurants\n* Bars\n* Events\n* Fitness\n\n\n\n1. [Home](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n2. [Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n3. [Western Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-western-mumbai-mumbai)\n4. [Kandivali West](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-kandivali-west-mumbai)\n5. [Charkop](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-charkop-kandivali-west-mumbai)\n6. Sangam Emporio Towers\n\n[![Sangam Emporio Towers Project Images 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/6vqIo8wF9zasf0a046NuzFySpMHMfKYxqQKODOBI.webp)](#)\n\n[![Sangam Emporio Towers Project Images 2](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/SilRtjum5OB1wvcdvKP0FZQXSKAIqzkEgASSuoBM.webp)](#)\n\n\n\n## About Sangam Emporio Towers\n\n### Overview\n\n![Project Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/network.svg) Project Area\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) No. of Storey's\n\n![Parking Type](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Parking Type\n\n0.92 Acres\n\n22 Storeys\n\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nDecember 2025\n\nReady To Move In\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\n### **Sangam Emporio Towers Kandarpada – Project Overview**\n\nSangam Emporio Towers is a premium residential development by Sangam Developers, located in Charkop, Kandivali West, Mumbai. The project is designed to offer modern urban living with compact yet well-planned homes, making it ideal for families, professionals, and investors seeking connectivity and everyday convenience in Mumbai’s western suburbs.\n\n### **Apartment Configuration & Carpet Area**\n\nSangam Emporio Towers offers a wide range of thoughtfully designed apartments to suit different lifestyle needs:\n\n* **Configuration:** 1 RK, 1 BHK, 2 BHK & 3 BHK Apartments\n* **Carpet Area:** 249 sq. ft. to 1108 sq. ft.\n* **Design:** Efficient layouts with optimal space utilization and natural ventilation\n\n### **Project Area & Building Details**\n\n* **Total Project Area:** 0.92 Acres\n* **Number of Storeys:** 22 Storeys\n\nThe project features well-planned residential towers with a focus on functionality, comfort, and modern living.\n\n### **RERA Registration & Possession Details**\n\n* **RERA Registration Number:** P51800031000\n* **Project Status:** Under Construction\n* **Possession Date:** December 2025\n\nThe project is RERA registered, ensuring transparency, timely delivery, and buyer confidence.\n\n### **Location Advantages of Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West**\n\nSangam Emporio Towers enjoys a strategic location in Kandivali West with excellent connectivity to key areas such as:\n\n* Link Road & SV Road\n* Borivali, Malad, and Goregaon\n* Upcoming metro stations and major transit routes\n* Schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and daily essentials\n\nKandivali West continues to be a preferred residential destination due to its strong infrastructure and growing connectivity.\n\n### **Why Choose Sangam Emporio Towers**\n\nSangam Emporio Towers stands out for its prime location, multiple apartment configurations, and efficient planning. The project is well-suited for end-users looking for comfortable city living as well as buyers seeking long-term value in Mumbai’s western corridor.\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nSangam Emporio Towers brochure\n\n## Pricing of Sangam Emporio Towers\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [1 BHK Apartment](#tabs-3)\n* [1 RK Apartment](#tabs-2)\n* [2 BHK Apartment](#tabs-5)\n* [3 BHK Apartment](#tabs-7)\n\n* [249 sqft](#tabs-9052)\n* [408 sqft](#tabs-9053)\n* [433 sqft](#tabs-9054)\n* [450 sqft](#tabs-9055)\n* [524 sqft](#tabs-9056)\n* [526 sqft](#tabs-9057)\n* [408 sqft](#tabs-31571)\n* [433 sqft](#tabs-31572)\n* [450 sqft](#tabs-31573)\n* [526 sqft](#tabs-31574)\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n1 BHK | Carpet Area: 249 sqft | Price:\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n1 BHK | Carpet Area: 408 sqft | Price:\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n1 BHK | Carpet Area: 433 sqft | Price:\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n1 BHK | Carpet Area: 450 sqft | Price:\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n1 BHK | Carpet Area: 524 sqft | Price:\n