udies\n* Dumpty Humpty Pre School & Activity Centre\n* New Blossoms Montessori Preschool & Daycare in Borivali\n* Ryan International School, Kandivali East, Mumbai - CBSE\n* Swami Vivekanand International School\n* Thakur Specialized Degree College\n* Niranjana Majithia College of Commerce\n\n**Hospitals in Kandivali West**\n\n* Thunga Hospital\n* ACE Heart Hospital\n* CritiCare Asia Multispeciality Hospital\n* Cloudnine Hospital - Malad | Best Maternity & Pregnancy Centre\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Kandivali West**\n\n* Infiniti Mall - Malad West\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Inorbit Mall Malad\n* D Mart\n\n## About Sangam Developers\n\n![Sangam Developers](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/HtIBnOfRQSeu9vuSsXWzdne1KR2qxlbvURJzxcc9.webp)\n\n* Year Estd. 1985\n* [Projects - 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/sangam-developers-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Sangam Developers\n\nSangam Developers\n\n## QR Codes of Sangam Emporio Towers\n\n![P51800031000.webp](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/3Uap7ODf2PMRsUvDdjlz4OOAFfsCm4sf8SeIxDe4.webp) P51800031000\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Sangam Emporio Towers\n\nWhat is the address of Sangam Emporio Towers?\n\nThe Sangam Emporio Towers is located at Charkop, Sector 2 Charkop, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra.  [Book Site Visit Here](#myModal)\n\nWhat is Rera Number of Sangam Emporio Towers?\n\nSangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West RERA number is P51800031000.\n\nWhat configurations are available at Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West?\n\nSangam Emporio Towers offers premium 1,3,2,1 RK BHK Apartment flats for sale in Kandivali West.\n\nWhat is the starting price of a flat at Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West?\n\nSangam Emporio Towers flat price in Kandivali West starts at ₹ 99.00 Lac Onwards.\n\n...\n\nHow many floors are there in the Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West project?\n\nThe Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West project boasts 22 storeys offering well-planned layouts and modern amenities.\n\nWhat is the Possession Date of Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West?\n\nThe project is Ready To Move In   \n The Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West RERA possession is scheduled for December 2025.\n\nWhy choose the Sangam Emporio Towers residential project in Kandivali West?\n\nSangam Emporio Towers is one of the best  [residential projects in Kandivali West](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/residential-property-for-sale-in-kandivali-west-mumbai) for both investment and living purposes. Get access to the best of schools, hospitals, and entertainment hubs.  [Express your interest today](#myModal)\n\nFrom where to get the floor plan of Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West?\n\nThe Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West floor plan is designed for optimum use and plenty of natural light. The layouts are designed as per Vastu principles.  [Check out the floor plan here.](#myModal)\n\nFrom where to get the price sheet of Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West?\n\nThe Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West price sheet is important for clarity on the price breakdown and other payment details of the flat.  [Check price sheet](#myModal)\n\nWhat are the stamp duty and registration charges in Kandivali West’s Sangam Emporio Towers project?\n\nThe stamp duty and registration charges in Kandivali West for Sangam Emporio Towers may vary depending on current government regulations. For the latest update connect with our sales team. [Call Now](tel:7045670457)\n\nWhat kind of amenities are available at Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West?\n\nThe Sangam Emporio Towers project in Kandivali West offers a wide range of lifestyle amenities, including a swimming pool, jogging track, gym, kids play area, multipurpose lawn, garden, senior citizen zone, and more.\n\nHow is the connectivity near Sangam Emporio Towers Kandivali West?\n\nStrategically located on in Kandivali West, Sangam Emporio Towers enjoys exceptional connectivity via roads, highways, and railways. The upcoming infrastructure makes it easier for daily travelers.\n\n## More Projects near Kandivali West\n\n[![Sayba Aramya](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/sayba-aramya-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8870) \n\n### [Sayba Aramya](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/sayba-aramya-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8870)\n\n##### by Sayba Group\n\n1,2,3 BHK Apartment  \n Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 1.11 Cr - 2.59 Cr\n\n[![PCPL Rajesh Mandir](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/pcpl-rajesh-mandir-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8823) \n\n### [PCPL Rajesh Mandir](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/pcpl-rajesh-mandir-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8823)\n\n##### by PCPL\n\n1,2 BHK Apartment  \n Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 1.49 Cr - 2.11 Cr\n\n[![Paradigm kandivali West Mahavir nagar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/paradigm-kandivali-west-mahavir-nagar-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8819) \n\n### [Paradigm kandivali West Mahavir nagar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/paradigm-kandivali-west-mahavir-nagar-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8819)\n\n##### by Paradigm Realty\n\n1 BHK Apartment  \n Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 90.00 Lac - 1.95 Cr\n\n[![Godrej Mahavir nagar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/godrej-mahavir-nagar-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8813) \n\n### [Godrej Mahavir nagar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/godrej-mahavir-nagar-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/8813)\n\n##### by Godrej Properties\n\n3,4 BHK Apartment  \n Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 5.94 Cr - 10.72 Cr\n\n[![Navka