e?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 65.11 Lakhs to 2.46 Cr\\*\n\n![Sangam Emporio Towers](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/70780/1675077989_e1.jpg \"Sangam Emporio Towers\")\n\n# Sangam Emporio Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Sangam Emporio Towers](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/70780/1675077989_e1.jpg \"Sangam Emporio Towers\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 ,2 ,3 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 249 sqft - 942 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 204 Units & 3 Towers\n* Total Project Area: 0.92 Acres\n* Possession: December, 2024\n* Rera: P51800031000\n\n## About\n\nSangam Emporio Towers is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Kandivali West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 0.92 Acres, the project features 204 Units in 3 Towers, offering a mix of 1 BHK+1T, to 3 BHK+3T Apartments ranging from 249 sqft to 942 sqft. The address for the project is sector 2, charkop, kandivali west, mumbai, maharashtra..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Sangam Emporio Towers are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 BHK+1T units start at 249 sqft. The larger 3 BHK+3T Apartments go up to 942 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Sangam Emporio Towers are designed to be accessible, with 1 BHK+1T units priced from 65.11 Lakhs and 3 BHK+3T Apartments from 2.46 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Sangam Developers, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800031000 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2024-12-18, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nSangam Emporio Towers is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Club house, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 0.92 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 204 Units, 3 Towers\n* Sizes: 249 sqft to 942 sqft\n* Project Address: sector 2, charkop, kandivali west, mumbai, maharashtra.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Sangam Developers\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800031000 Units\n* Possession Start: 2024-12-18\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nSangam Emporio Towers benefits from its location in Kandivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Sangam Emporio Towers will begin in 2024-12-18, and the project is RERA registered under P51800031000 Units. Developed by Sangam Developers, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![Club house](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804551_club-house.svg) Club house\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![CCTV](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528887020_cctv.svg) CCTV\n\n## Floor Plans of Sangam Emporio Towers\n\n![Sangam Emporio Towers Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/images/no-image.jpg \"Sangam Emporio Towers Floor Plan 249 sqft\")\n\n1 BHK (249 Sq. Ft.)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Sangam Emporio Towers Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/images/no-image.jpg \"Sangam Emporio Towers Floor Plan 450 sqft\")\n\n1 BHK (450 Sq. Ft.)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 52.09 Lakhs\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Rental Listings →](https://rental.addressofchoice.com/property-for-rent-in-sangam-emporio-towers-kandivali-west-mumbai-prop70780)\n\n## Bank Offers for Sangam Emporio Towers\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958784_sbi.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958779_icici.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958773_hdfc.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958767_axis.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958761_canara.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958377_indiabulls.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958423_pnb.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958411_tata.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528957944_reliance_capital.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528956975_dhfl.png \" \")\n\n![imageBackh](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/imageBackh.png)\n\n## Hi! I'm here to answer all your queries.\n\n**Vaishali Vasant Tiwari**  \n Relationship Manager\n\n[Chat with us](https://wa.me/8800117588?text=I'm%20interested%20in%20Sangam Emporio Towers)\n\n## Sangam Emporio Towers Specifications